flowchart TD
    PlatformOperator[Platform Operator\nTenacity internal user]
    ClientAdmin[Client Admin / User\nClient tenant]
    CustomerUser[Customer Admin / User\nCustomer tenant]

    FMSAdmin[apps/FMS.Admin\nOperator portal]
    FMSFrontend[apps/fms.frontend\nClient and customer portal]
    FMSMobile[apps/fms.mobile\nMobile workflows]
    Landing[apps/FMS.Landing\nPublic sales entry]

    WebClient[apps/FMS.WebClient\nMain API host]
    SalesApi[FMS.Sales.Api\nSales bounded context]
    Application[packages/FMS.Application\nCQRS features and services]
    Persistence[packages/FMS.Persistence\nGPSDataContext]
    Domain[packages/FMS.Domain\nDomain entities]
    MySql[(MySQL operational database)]

    DeviceCore[FMS.Devices.Core\nProvider registry and routing]
    TrackingHost[services/FMS.Devices.Tracking.Host\nTracking worker]
    FuelingHost[services/FMS.PTS.WindowsService\nLegacy fueling host]
    TrackingProviders[Tracking provider APIs\nGPSGate / GPSWox]
    FuelingDevices[Fueling devices\nPTS / ATG]
    Redis[(Redis command channel)]
    RabbitMq[(RabbitMQ events)]

    PlatformOperator --> FMSAdmin
    ClientAdmin --> FMSFrontend
    CustomerUser --> FMSFrontend
    CustomerUser --> FMSMobile
    Landing --> SalesApi

    FMSAdmin --> WebClient
    FMSFrontend --> WebClient
    FMSMobile --> WebClient

    WebClient --> Application
    Application --> Persistence
    Persistence --> Domain
    Persistence --> MySql

    WebClient --> DeviceCore
    TrackingHost --> DeviceCore
    TrackingHost --> TrackingProviders
    TrackingHost --> RabbitMq
    FuelingHost --> DeviceCore
    FuelingHost --> Redis
    FuelingHost --> FuelingDevices
    DeviceCore --> Persistence

    SalesApi --> SalesDb[(Sales database)]

    subgraph TenancyBoundary[Tenant and permission boundary]
      Application
      Persistence
      MySql
    end